Description: Provides tools to import, validate, visualise and aggregate
    expert estimates for continuous and categorical variables. Analysis of
    continuous variables supports one-, three- and four-point, confidence-based
    rescaling and sampling from PERT. Analysis of categorical variables supports
    Dirichlet distributions, and weighted aggregation. You provide the data, and
    elicitr transforms them into easily readable graphics.Implements workflows
    adapted from the IDEA protocol described by Hemming et al. (2018) 
    <doi:10.1111/2041-210X.12857> and categorical elicitation described by
    Vernet et al. (2024)
    <doi:10.1007/s10530-024-03341-2>. 
